      "writtenOn": "2023-01-30T21:09:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are these GPIOs initialized anywhere?  The `gpio-keys` compatible C driver doesn\u0027t actually exist in Zephyr upstream.  Board that use this upstream generally use the node-label or an alias to find the GPIO pins to initialize.  You don\u0027t have any board code referencing anything in this file best I can tell.\n\nSo this file seems to be adding unused nodes into the devicetree.",
